{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "c68787d1ed5bb5c31d6e782a623710108534eb86345a04cf3b1072e035f0dacf", "ja": "なかよし、できるかな？", "zh": "有办法融洽相处吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "dfda0dae0868a1f23cc77c1f41c51301997d118a27cf808acfd32f46962c652c", "ja": "子ども番組『☆ピコピコプラネット☆』の\nリハーサルが始まった。ドラマパートは\n完璧だが、問題は子ども達と仲良くできるか\nどうか。アイドル達はそれぞれ幼い頃を思い\n出し、子ども達と仲良しになることを誓う。", "zh": "儿童节目《☆PIKO PIKO PLANET☆》\n开始进行排练了。虽然偶像们在戏剧部分\n表现得很完美，然而关键在于是否能\n与小朋友融洽相处。她们各自回忆起\n童年时光，并誓言要和孩子们打成一片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1000_035hin", "source_sha256": "8beeb8f7873ec87b72e3c1991670d4ac32ba51a2d988c316c2ccb3ccebf0a6c4", "ja": "銀河系の彼方にある星、ミリオン星……。", "zh": "位于银河系另一端的星球，百万行星……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "92a6d3cd3c30119ca284864f91298dd70e80a92bad5c7aefaf1b537a0bc0b954", "ja": "そこに住むミリオン星人は、歌とダンスが大好き！", "zh": "住在那里的百万星人，最喜欢唱歌跳舞了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "0b090b23b0dd0a87f6bd529fd55d2aa0aa7818ac9d74f3ef2759973ddf15577a", "ja": "ステージを見たみんなを\n『せんのー』して『せーふく』しちゃうんだ！", "zh": "百万星人会把看到表演的所有人\n都『洗脑』和『征服』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "8ca0f85352dc1a3580a4052763237faaeff3830ef3c13afc861bf8fefe239c66", "ja": "だから杏奈たち、銀河中の人達と\n一緒に歌いたくって、旅に出たの♪", "zh": "所以杏奈我们，才会为了和全银河的人们\n一起唱歌，而踏上旅途♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "ffc16d7c7c1b3e0f29ce9c4b97a1ce72cd077b91b6237a0fcfc74da73bb0bd3e", "ja": "けど、宇宙船が壊れて、\n地球に不時着しちゃったんだべさ。", "zh": "但是太空船坏掉了，\n我们只好紧急降落在地球哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "7d03adffcef74b2ea25adc0cf51840032856928cd56459b1f2eb47ee3d9cffb2", "ja": "ミリオン星に帰れなくなっちゃったぞ！？\nどうしよ～！？", "zh": "现在回不了百万行星了耶！？\n该怎么办啊～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "731b4fddd728fd7d23667dc7759d3214e4adf1a0c0670d5e41016a93444edb43", "ja": "地球のみんなから、\n宇宙船の部品を分けてもらうため……。", "zh": "为了让地球上的人\n分给我们一点太空船的零件……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "0eb27fe62c3a6eba55903e8d5b5e50bfbb566f706657e445063ec5619f1e618d", "ja": "歌とダンスで、地球人を\n『せんのー』して、『せーふく』しなきゃ！", "zh": "我们要唱歌跳舞，『洗脑』地球人，\n然后『征服』他们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "f0bf95682b63111088083264a33b53be48ceec7d56b51fdc9b775b33f6992a52", "ja": "合言葉は？", "zh": "口号是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "8fa2d8cebb176d0c8dfa65b215c1b193ece282fe648762fb43d6a0f47378ddf7", "ja": "せんのー！　せーふく！　せんせーしょん！", "zh": "洗脑！征服！大骚动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "8fa2d8cebb176d0c8dfa65b215c1b193ece282fe648762fb43d6a0f47378ddf7", "ja": "せんのー！　せーふく！　せんせーしょん！", "zh": "洗脑！征服！大骚动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "8fa2d8cebb176d0c8dfa65b215c1b193ece282fe648762fb43d6a0f47378ddf7", "ja": "せんのー！　せーふく！　せんせーしょん！", "zh": "洗脑！征服！大骚动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "8fa2d8cebb176d0c8dfa65b215c1b193ece282fe648762fb43d6a0f47378ddf7", "ja": "せんのー！　せーふく！　せんせーしょん！", "zh": "洗脑！征服！大骚动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "4574d07ed78a994df80df0d102ed73cd96da148d67f23363b6c1f65648cab704", "ja": "……よし、みんなリハーサルは完璧だな！", "zh": "……很好，大家排练得很完美呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "dd24875014145a35503b47bc6be76c2597cd3db2d5b4c6eb7c0ebc7c527aeeaa", "ja": "えへへ、上手にできてましたか……？", "zh": "嘿嘿，我表现得好吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "b8e6971afb7826889333da4cafea500c692c2398c396531bde507fbf6805c6ed", "ja": "杏奈たち……、エイリアン、っぽかった……かな？", "zh": "杏奈我们……有演得像是外星人……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "8246b55ed4850d41a674b40b814f6f8171ea5c011df35e3ede87e63065ca7d98", "ja": "宇宙人役なんてすごいぞ～っ！\nたまきも宇宙人と友達になれるかな？　くふふ♪", "zh": "居然能演外星人，好棒喔～！\n环也可以和外星人当好朋友吗？呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "82903fca40e42d1f34d2edcaf51289d1cfc718c160edc029c5b85942de809995", "ja": "けども、『せんのー』に『せーふく』なんて\nあんまり穏やかじゃないねぇ。", "zh": "不过『洗脑』和『征服』这些词\n听起来满危险的呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "24b97d192de78e3cf0c58da4c562b1aa8f3c264dac4d3ae56d030994852a3572", "ja": "まあ、表現はちょっと過激だよな。\n先進的というか、攻めてるというか……。", "zh": "嗯，这种表现方式是有点大胆。\n该说是先进吗？还是具有挑战精神呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "bcfa26073792b6126e58a91535a29f6f09409f98fa354aef0f2cf6dd7d69be58", "ja": "ミリオン星人の言葉で、『せんのー』って\n歌とダンスのことなんですよね？", "zh": "百万星人的语言里，\n『洗脑』就是指唱歌跳舞对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1020_p", "source_sha256": "1f52a6fa7821949ba4dd3e016c3ede59e1289eef9d156136ff206602874f28de", "ja": "そう、それで番組のミッションをクリアしたら\n『せーふく』完了だ！", "zh": "对啊，而且只要完成节目的任务，\n就可以成功『洗脑』了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "7bb80606832710003e07e8c03378addb226090c45df1191269f6feb4a5e209d3", "ja": "それじゃ、みんなに喜んでもらうってことだから、\n悪い宇宙人じゃないですよね。よかったです！", "zh": "也就是说我们是要为大家带来快乐，\n那就不是坏外星人了吧？真是太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "1bbebc93297e17e30332cbf989df7db5e2d2d5532de164681a147eadc1303c9b", "ja": "そうだな。良い宇宙人として、がんばってくれよ！\nそれと、今回の番組収録は子ども達と一緒だ。", "zh": "对呀，你们要当一群好外星人，努力加油喔！\n还有啊，你们这次要跟小朋友一起录节目喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1023_p", "source_sha256": "9e470920f0b50750f8ce1c0a24c2f1e7cd4ed5c481e7d66d6a2d2449aa74a625", "ja": "子ども達とも仲良くなることが、\n番組を成功させるカギになると思う。", "zh": "跟孩子们融洽相处，\n应该就是让节目顺利成功的关键吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1024_022ser", "source_sha256": "7244e76d65e928dd1d2defc79b864f82183047ab74a3767f09a92f919ea01064", "ja": "小学校に入る前の小さい子たちなんですよね。", "zh": "他们是还没上小学的小朋友对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1025_040tam", "source_sha256": "4789ef669709926ae79e053c777f788bbef04df6ecb0fe142704bc6b2f71747b", "ja": "小学校に入る前って、どんなことして遊んでたっけ？\n昔すぎて、たまき、思い出せないぞ～？", "zh": "上小学以前，都是在玩什么啊？\n太久以前了，环想不起来耶～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1026_024ann", "source_sha256": "3c1fb38af024dc4386b3eae60d2d55dc4825d6877da51b8250c5882a878e1529", "ja": "杏奈……、何のゲーム……\nしてた、かな……。", "zh": "杏奈……以前都……\n在玩什么游戏呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1027_035hin", "source_sha256": "784128fcf20abe2491df6c58b8f6ba76f7dfec012360bfad93165d8b842e243b", "ja": "あたしも、どうしてたかねぇ。よく、ばあちゃんに手を\nひいてもらってたのは、覚えてるんだけども……", "zh": "我也没什么印象哪～\n我只记得以前奶奶常牵着我的手……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1028_p", "source_sha256": "28f45144554befe007570813bcf1e0c535165817ffc6d83a659e12fc86f32283", "ja": "（大人から見れば、そんなに年の差があるとは思えない\nけど……当人達にとっては、大きな差なんだな）", "zh": "（虽然从大人眼里看起来，不会觉得她们跟小孩\n年纪差很多……但是对当事人来说，差距很大呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1029_022ser", "source_sha256": "3f33e7d3f0939a125249ad62fc3252b31588016726985c2a45340e8c442706ad", "ja": "小さかったころのことって、\n意外と思い出せないものなんですね……。", "zh": "小时候的事情，\n其实想不太起来呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1030_022ser", "source_sha256": "3a2fd23a2969ad731a40cb255b511eb3855c2bd24745e7148f746498349ab2da", "ja": "わたし達、ちゃんと子ども達の気持ち、\nわかってあげられるのかな……？", "zh": "我们真的能够\n好好理解孩子们的心情吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1031_024ann", "source_sha256": "c734a6f67177de63bc1210ee1916bfae95704ca8b6415969fb98174112b1ee09", "ja": "うん……。\nすこし、不安……かも……。", "zh": "嗯……\n好像……有点不放心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1032_040tam", "source_sha256": "24bc32545fcca4ad7244a28041a224eb3a1aaca2bd895b79ee81748c88aeefa6", "ja": "う～ん、どうすれば仲良くなれるんだろ～？", "zh": "嗯～要怎么样才能跟他们感情变好呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1033_035hin", "source_sha256": "9896b9d861c1acdf86649920a2e631d87c6d3c654d1b6c3cdca99949f14de4cb", "ja": "でも……。あたしらより、子ども達のほうが、\nもっと緊張してるんでないかい？", "zh": "不过……比起我们，\n孩子们可能更紧张吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1034_035hin", "source_sha256": "aacee67d7f691afb63b748bccbf2bea676ac382d9570218684b3e363e5663d42", "ja": "まだちっちゃいのに、\nお父さんお母さんと離れて仕事をしてるんだもの。", "zh": "毕竟他们年纪还那么小，\n就要跟爸爸妈妈分开，自己工作了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1035_035hin", "source_sha256": "34aa48a5f5b8a3c4164345fc348b8106900b3d6648f89869e0c6469c306433db", "ja": "だから、あたしらがお姉さんとしてしっかりせねば。\n子ども達が安心できるようにしてあげたいっしょや。", "zh": "所以我们身为姊姊，要好好表现才行。\n我想要让孩子们能够放心哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1036_022ser", "source_sha256": "994b5c418b37030d454ec9c636e3a7d30ab66664a9712b934538bd21bebe1b3e", "ja": "あっ、そうですよね。今度の番組では、\nわたし達、おねえさんになるんですよね！", "zh": "啊，你说得对。\n在这次的节目里，我们要扮演大姊姊呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1037_040tam", "source_sha256": "6f5991eabf52e4efff8531a9d8c49d53f269d2b86d66c94bf07bd76577b1997a", "ja": "そっか。たまきたち、おねえさんなんだ……！\nくふふ、わかったぞ！", "zh": "对耶，环我们是大姊姊呀……！\n呵呵，环知道了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1038_040tam", "source_sha256": "c1f6e9197fb7c4475ba8d3d685a10ffefc5bc9ae5d73f8b32a07a4292bfb15c8", "ja": "たまきも、劇場のみんなが遊んでくれたから、\n東京でもさびしくなかったんだ。", "zh": "环也是多亏有剧场的伙伴们陪环一起玩，\n所以在东京也不觉得寂寞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1039_040tam", "source_sha256": "dc2fc466245f1feb6a808358d69606f53ef61012eed4176c7ba5419d9496ec24", "ja": "だから、こんどはたまきが子ども達と、\nいっぱい遊んであげるね！", "zh": "所以这次就换环\n来陪小朋友们玩个够吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1040_022ser", "source_sha256": "0ed30bb7f4ef38aae9b810ea1714fab6c9d580c724da5dac50fae794341bc8b4", "ja": "はい♪　たくさん遊んで、\nたくさん仲良しになりましょうね！", "zh": "嗯♪我们要一起玩很多游戏，\n跟大家打成一片！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1041_024ann", "source_sha256": "fc10900fdd57b0ec588383d585b36bab48a7cca3219d5cbaf9aeabc2f20c9453", "ja": "ん……。杏奈、子どもの好きなゲーム……\n見つける、ね♪", "zh": "嗯……杏奈会找到……\n小朋友喜欢玩的游戏的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_01_1042_p", "source_sha256": "dc30f9f29adc56325c66cec44a58b68dd144c9da37e63ae1e7e243a18eb62983", "ja": "（どんな仕事にも正面から向き合って悩むアイドル達。\nその気持ちがあれば、きっと大丈夫だ！）", "zh": "（不管是什么工作，偶像们都会正面迎战、绞尽脑汁。\n只要她们有这份心，就一定没问题的！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
